crcpp
------------------------------------------
CRC++ is a portable and lightweight C++ CRC library.

Runtime requirements:
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/d-bahr/CRCpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/d-bahr/CRCpp/archive/refs/tags/release-1.2.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack crcpp-1.2.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./crcpp-1.2.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/crcpp-1.2.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/crcpp-1.2.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(crcpp)
  /usr/include/CRC.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/crcpp/CRCppConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/crcpp/CRCppConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/crcpp/CRCppTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/cps/CRCpp.cps
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/CRCpp.pc
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/crcpp.README
  /usr/share/doc/crcpp/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/crcpp/README.md

------------------

